{"n": 1293, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "1293.webp", "text": "Remove left and right light bulb\nholders.\n\nUncilp plug (1) by pressing In both\ntabs.\n\nConnect connection with the additional\nwire harness.\n\nClip additional wire harness plug in the\ntall lights.\n\nPlace plug behind the side trim panel;\nsecure with straps.\n\nInstall tight bulb holder.\n\nAdditionally in Cars with Check Control.\nPull off lett wheel house trim pane!\npartially.\n\nRoute additional electric leads along\nthe standard wire harness.\n\nUnscrew control unit.\n\nPull multiple-pin plug (1) off of the\ncontrol unit and connect It with female\nplug (2) of the additional electric lead.\nConnect multiple-pin plug (3) of the\nadditional electric lead on the contro!\nunit.\n\nScrew on control unit.\n\nFunction Test:\n\nConnect battery ground lead.\n\nAlways make sure that connections of\npertinent plug match the connections\nof the socket.\n\nCheck operation of trailer lights and\nturn signals after hitching a trailer.\nThe additional Indicator lamp flashes\nonly when a traller is hauled.\n\nInstall all removed parts.\n\nInstall drawbar load label.\n\nimportant!\n\nFuse No. 6 (7.5 amps) In cars with\nadditional stop lights must be\nexchanged against a 15 ampere fuse.", "words": [["Remove", 0.2715, 0.0769, 0.3151, 0.0889], ["left", 0.3191, 0.0776, 0.3354, 0.0889], ["and", 0.3394, 0.0776, 0.3587, 0.0889], ["right", 0.3632, 0.0776, 0.387, 0.0915], ["light", 0.3916, 0.0776, 0.4144, 0.0915], ["bulb", 0.4184, 0.0776, 0.4417, 0.0889], ["holders.", 0.2715, 0.0935, 0.3146, 0.1048], ["Uncilp", 0.272, 0.311, 0.306, 0.3256], ["plug", 0.31, 0.3117, 0.3333, 0.3263], ["(1)", 0.3374, 0.3117, 0.3501, 0.3249], ["by", 0.3546, 0.3117, 0.3668, 0.3256], ["pressing", 0.3713, 0.3117, 0.4174, 0.3256], ["In", 0.4215, 0.3117, 0.4306, 0.3223], ["both", 0.4347, 0.3117, 0.458, 0.3229], ["tabs.", 0.2715, 0.3276, 0.2979, 0.3395], ["Connect", 0.272, 0.5438, 0.3171, 0.5557], ["connection", 0.3212, 0.5451, 0.3799, 0.5557], ["